    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>[Retail Company Simulator: Prologue is a free prologue version of Retail Company Simulator. In this game, you'll have a limited amount of contracts.]<br><br>This is a first-person simulation game where you run a retail company.<br>Expand your humble store into a huge retail company.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/97f7577783f0c18dee9ec543fc519068.poster.avif?t=1750239511\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/97f7577783f0c18dee9ec543fc519068.webm?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/97f7577783f0c18dee9ec543fc519068.mp4?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store Workflow</h2>Sign contracts with leading brands, order new products with an in-game computer, unpack the boxes, place the products into your store, and set the prices for your products.<br>Consider the market prices while setting up your product prices in the store for customer satisfaction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/26eb8bd3156eb49ac63d279df0df06f8.poster.avif?t=1750239511\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/26eb8bd3156eb49ac63d279df0df06f8.webm?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/26eb8bd3156eb49ac63d279df0df06f8.mp4?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Products</h2>Please make sure your customers find all their needs in the store.<br>Always expand your product portfolio and satisfy your customers.<br>Shirts, jackets, pants, sweatshirts, dresses, t-shirts, shoes, hats, and more...<br>Be aware of the market prices and purchase more products when they're cheap.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/ff25b7bda694ec627e9b011223aa40e5.poster.avif?t=1750239511\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/ff25b7bda694ec627e9b011223aa40e5.webm?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/ff25b7bda694ec627e9b011223aa40e5.mp4?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers</h2>Place a sufficient number of checkouts and fitting rooms to reduce the waiting time for customers.<br>Scan products and collect payments whether in cash or with card purchases.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/bf20ea19e5eb25a1ba49ede8f8382b35.poster.avif?t=1750239511\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/bf20ea19e5eb25a1ba49ede8f8382b35.webm?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/bf20ea19e5eb25a1ba49ede8f8382b35.mp4?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansions and New Teammates</h2>Expand your store and warehouse by leveling up your store and budget.<br>Hire stockers to fill the racks.<br>Purchase more cash registers and hire new cashiers to minimize long queues at the checkouts and to reduce waiting time for customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/e119dc4f1d77b3f10c39e16d81342c4e.poster.avif?t=1750239511\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/e119dc4f1d77b3f10c39e16d81342c4e.webm?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089150/extras/e119dc4f1d77b3f10c39e16d81342c4e.mp4?t=1750239511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
